  {
   "key": "func ThresholdCards.detectAlpha1Crossings(samples:)",
   "hash": "ad8f856517e84575",
   "does": "Walks Alpha1ReportCards.timedCleanAlpha1 readings (beat-artifact dips excluded, each reading timed against the previous α1 sample and capped at 5 s) from the 120 s warm-up on, and feeds AT1 (0.75) and AT2 (0.50) BandTrackers; a down-crossing needs a reading at or above the threshold after the warm-up first, commits after 180 s of sub-threshold time, and an up-crossing is emitted on recovery after a committed down-crossing. Returns at most 6 events; its first AT1 down-crossing is the report's first crossing.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Views/Alpha1ReportCards+Report.swift::func Alpha1ReportCards.timedCleanAlpha1(samples:shadows:)",
